{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "equipment-equipment-extended-2026-09-23",
    "name": "设备字典接口（wk-customer-pricing）· 等价类扩展版",
    "description": "设备字典 8 个接口的 Postman 集合 v2.1（**等价类扩展版**）。\n\n**与原版差异**：原版每个接口 1 条 happy path；本版每个写接口扩展为 6-10 条等价类用例（覆盖正向/负向/边界/异常），与 [Apifox-AI提示词模板.md](./Apifox-AI提示词模板.md)「模块 3 设备字典维护」配套，作为用户在 Apifox Web 中点「🤖 AI 生成用例」的参照模板。\n\n**使用说明**\n\n1. 先在集合 Variables 中按环境修改 `baseUrl`（默认 `http://localhost:8031`）和 `token`（裸 JWT，无 Bearer 前缀）；\n2. 鉴权已统一预置：集合级 Authorization 头直接携带裸 token（取变量 `{{token}}`），全部请求自动继承；\n3. 每条用例已内置测试脚本：断言 HTTP 200 + body.code 断言；\n4. 变量提取：写操作响应中提取的 id/code 通过 `pm.collectionVariables.set` 写入，后续链式用例通过 `{{equipmentId}}` / `{{equipmentCode}}` 等占位符引用；\n5. 建议顺序：1.新增 → 2-4.列表/详情 → 5-7.改/停/删 → 8-10.前台只读。\n\n**业务规则速记**：code 系统生成（父分类code.3位序号）不可传参；中文名同分类下精确唯一；停用只影响前台可见性；删除为逻辑删除（型号关联校验见型号模块 BR-EQ-05）；R-01 设备不参与定价；IN-EQ-02 父分类不存在拒绝；IN-EQ-03 父分类已停用拒绝；IN-EQ-04 状态仅 0/1；BR-EQ-10 同分类下 name 唯一。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      { "key": "key", "value": "Authorization", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "value", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "in", "value": "header", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8031" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "categoryId", "value": "10" },
    { "key": "categoryIdDisabled", "value": "99999" },
    { "key": "equipmentId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "equipmentCode", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. 新增设备 · 正向用例集",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 正向 · 新增典型（英文名）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"categoryId\":{{categoryId}},\"name\":\"主机柴油机-正向\",\"nameEn\":\"Main Diesel Engine - Positive\"}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/web/equipment/add", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["web", "equipment", "add"] },
            "description": "正向：categoryId 指向启用分类 + 中文名合法 + 英文名可选 → 期望 200 + code=00000000 + 返回新 id+code"
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                "var body = pm.response.json();",
                "pm.test(\"code=00000000 业务成功\", function () { pm.expect(body.code).to.eql('00000000'); });",
                "pm.test(\"返回 id + code\", function () { pm.expect(body.data.id).to.exist; pm.expect(body.data.code).to.exist; });",
                "pm.collectionVariables.set('equipmentId', body.data.id);",
                "pm.collectionVariables.set('equipmentCode', body.data.code);"
              ]
            }
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 正向 · 新增仅中文名（无英文名）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"categoryId\":{{categoryId}},\"name\":\"主机柴油机-纯中文\"}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/web/equipment/add", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["web", "equipment", "add"] },
            "description": "正向：nameEn 不传，nameEn 字段留空 → 期望成功"
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                "var body = pm.response.json();",
                "pm.test(\"code=00000000\", function () { pm.expect(body.code).to.eql('00000000'); });",
                "pm.test(\"返回 id+code\", function () { pm.expect(body.data.id).to.exist; pm.expect(body.data.code).to.exist; });"
              ]
            }
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.3 边界 · 中文名 100 字符上限",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"categoryId\":{{categoryId}},\"name\":\"{{name100}}\"}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/web/equipment/add", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["web", "equipment", "add"] },
            "description": "边界：name 正好 100 字符（@Size max=100 上限） → 期望成功"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.collectionVariables.set('name100', '测'.repeat(100));"]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"code=00000000 边界通过\", function () { pm.expect(body.code).to.eql('00000000'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2.1 异常 · categoryId 缺失",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"name\":\"无分类设备\"}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/web/equipment/add", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["web", "equipment", "add"] },
            "description": "异常：categoryId 字段缺失（@NotNull 校验） → 期望 200 + code 非零 + msg 提示"
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "pm.test(\"HTTP 200（业务层校验）\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                "var body = pm.response.json();",
                "pm.test(\"code 非零（参数校验失败）\", function () { pm.expect(body.code).to.not.eql('00000000'); });",
                "pm.test(\"msg 包含关键字\", function () { pm.expect(body.msg).to.match(/参数|categoryId|不能为空/); });"
              ]
            }
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "2.2 异常 · categoryId 不存在",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"categoryId\":999999999,\"name\":\"不存在的分类\"}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/web/equipment/add", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["web", "equipment", "add"] },
            "description": "异常：categoryId 指向不存在 id → 期望 803120302 (EQUIPMENT_CATEGORY_NOT_EXIST)"
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                "var body = pm.response.json();",
                "pm.test(\"code = 803120302 父分类不存在\", function () { pm.expect(body.code).to.eql('803120302'); });"
              ]
            }
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "2.3 异常 · 父分类已停用 → 803120303",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"categoryId\":{{categoryIdDisabled}},\"name\":\"停用分类下的设备\"}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/web/equipment/add", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["web", "equipment", "add"] },
            "description": "异常：父分类 status=0 → 期望 803120303 (EQUIPMENT_CATEGORY_DISABLED)"
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                "var body = pm.response.json();",
                "pm.test(\"code = 803120303 父分类已停用\", function () { pm.expect(body.code).to.eql('803120303'); });"
              ]
            }
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "2.4 异常 · name 缺失（@NotBlank）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"categoryId\":{{categoryId}},\"name\":\"\"}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/web/equipment/add", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["web", "equipment", "add"] },
            "description": "异常：name 空字符串（@NotBlank 校验） → 期望 code 非零"
          },
          "event": [{
